<title>USA: Comerica incorporates bank in Mexico City.</title>
<headline>Comerica incorporates bank in Mexico City.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comerica Inc said Monday it incorporated Comerica Bank Mexico S.A., a wholly owned subsidiary of Comerica Bank (Michigan). The new entity has full banking powers and will provide corporate banking and trade finance services in Mexico.</p>
<p>Based in Mexico City, Comerica Bank Mexico initially will focus on servicing middle market and large corporate companies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
